{
	"_readme": [
		"The pause menu end to end: Esc pauses, a slot is written, the player walks on, the slot",
		"is loaded, and the player is back where they saved.",
		"",
		"It tries to LOAD the empty slot first. That is refused - the state stays paused - and it",
		"is also the proof that a scripted session starts with no saves at all: a --qa-script= run",
		"points SaveManager at user://qa_saves and empties it at boot, so nothing a previous run,",
		"or a real player, wrote can be loaded here.",
		"",
		"Every open builds a fresh menu with the cursor on Resume, so the counts below are exact:",
		"the rows are Resume, Items, Equipment, Status, Save, Load, so Save is four move_downs and Load is five."
	],
